B.ZJ=A.a(s(["Device-Side Encryption: Every message, photo, and voice note is encrypted using libsodium (X25519 and XChaCha20-Poly1305) directly on your phone.","Zero Server Knowledge: The server only ever stores encrypted ciphertext. Nobody\u2014not even system admins\u2014can read your family's conversations.","Private Hardware Storage: Your encryption keys never leave your phone and are protected by your device's hardware security module.","Old Message Isolation: For absolute security, new members cannot read messages sent before they joined, and new phones cannot read past history without device key transfer.","Safe Push Notifications: Push notifications are data-only and never contain message text or media previews."]),t.s)
B.amx=new A.hz("Chat & Privacy","3. End-to-End Encryption (E2EE)",B.nM,B.j,"Military-grade privacy: zero outsiders, zero server eavesdropping.",B.ZJ,null,null)
B.XC=A.a(s(["Why Not Block? In real families, blocking or deleting a relative's family causes embarrassment and escalates arguments. Silent Curtain gives you peace without notifying the other family.",'\ud83e\ude9f Curtain Mode (Hide Completely): Completely hides that relative family from your Family Tree, Chat, and Birthdays\u2014tucking them into a discreet "Hidden Branches" drawer at the bottom.',"\ud83d\udd4a\ufe0f Peace Pause (7 / 30 Days Cooling-Off): Keeps the family in your tree, but silently mutes their cross-family invitations and alerts while everyone cools down.","\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Privacy Shield (Hide Our Updates): Prevents your family's invitations, status, working/living details, and birthday alerts from being shared with that family.",'Two Scopes & 1-Tap Reconciliation: Apply Curtain Mode for your "\ud83c\udfe0 Entire Family" (Admin) or "\ud83d\udc64 Only On My Phone". Whenever the families make peace, tap "Lift Curtain" to restore instantly!']),t.s)
B.amy=new A.hz("Family Tree & Peace","12. Silent Curtain (Peace & Hide Mode \u2014 Better Than Block)",B.ke,B.j,"Had a disagreement between two families? Silently hide or pause a relative family with zero notification and zero drama.",B.XC,"Manage in Family Tree","/family")
B.RV=new A.ae(62747,"MaterialIcons",null,!1)
B.a1S=A.a(s(["Minimum 16sp Text: All body text throughout OurNest is kept at a minimum of 16sp for easy legibility.",'Large Text Mode: Open Settings (\u2699\ufe0f) and switch on "Large Text Mode" to increase all fonts by 20%.',"Dark Mode: Toggle Dark Mode in Settings to reduce glare and eye fatigue.","48dp Minimum Touch Targets: All buttons and interactive icons are sized at 48dp or larger to prevent accidental clicks.","Warm Color Palette: Deep Forest Teal (#1F5C57), Warm Terracotta (#E07A4F), and Soft Cream (#F7F4EE) for high contrast and calm aesthetics."]),t.s)
B.amz=new A.hz("Accessibility","8. Elderly-Friendly Accessibility & Display",B.RV,B.j,"Large text mode (+20%), warm contrast colors, and 48dp touch targets.",B.a1S,"Configure in Settings","/settings")
B.YR=A.a(s(['Create a Family: Tap "Create a Family", choose a family name (e.g. "The Sharma Family"), and select your role (e.g. Father). You become the Family Admin.','Invite Code & QR: As the Admin, tap the QR icon on the Family screen to view your unique 6-character code (e.g. "SHRM92") and shareable QR code.','Join a Family: New members tap "Join a Family", type the 6-character code or scan the Admin\'s QR code, and select their relation (e.g. Son, Daughter, Mother).','Admin Approval Safety Gate: To keep strangers out, the Admin must tap "Approve" (\u2713) before the new member can see or send any messages.',"12 Family Relations: Father, Mother, Son, Daughter, Grandfather, Grandmother, Brother, Sister, Uncle, Aunt, Spouse, or Other with custom nickname."]),t.s)
B.amA=new A.hz("Setup & Family","2. Creating & Joining a Family Circle",B.nG,B.z,"How families connect, invite codes, QR scanning, and admin approvals.",B.YR,"Open Family Circle","/family")
B.YN=A.a(s(['Smart NLP Typing Detection: Type phrases like "wake me up 8am", "alarm 7:30", or "wake Rahul at 6am" in chat. A highlighted suggestion chip pops up immediately!','Tap the Suggestion Chip to instantly schedule the alarm, or tap the "+" icon and choose "Set Shared Alarm".',"Interactive Chat Alarm Card: An interactive card appears in the family chat showing status, target time, owner, and escalation member.","Exact Local Alarm: The owner's phone rings at the exact minute with a full-screen alarm, audio, and vibration.",'Owner Screen: Features a giant button "I\'M AWAKE \u2713" and a Snooze option. Tapping "I\'M AWAKE" sends an automatic confirmation to the family chat.','Escalation Alarm: If the person does NOT wake up within the grace period (e.g. 5 minutes), the parent\'s phone rings with a red alert and a prominent "[\ud83d\udcde Call Him]" phone dialer button!']),t.s)
B.amB=new A.hz("Shared Alarms","5. Shared Wake-Up Alarms & Escalation",B.i6,B.bh,"Smart typing alarms that ring the owner's phone and escalate if they oversleep.",B.YN,null,null)
B.XS=A.a(s(['Tap the "+" icon on the left of the chat bar and select "Family Reminder / Event".','Enter the title (e.g. "Grandma Doctor Appointment", "Rahul Tuition Fees Due", "Family Dinner").',"Pick the date, reminder time, and add optional notes.",'Choose whether to notify "All Family Members" or "Individual Members".','An interactive Calendar Card appears in the chat with a one-tap "[\ud83d\udcc5 Add to Calendar]" button that syncs directly to Google Calendar or Apple Calendar.',"Tap the checkbox on the reminder card to mark it as completed for the whole family."]),t.s)
B.amC=new A.hz("Reminders","6. Family Reminders & Calendar Events",B.nF,B.j,"Remind parents about medicines, doctors, tuition, and family events.",B.XS,null,null)
B.a14=A.a(s(["Why didn't my alarm ring? Open your phone's Settings > Apps > OurNest > Permissions > ensure \"Alarms & Reminders\" is set to Allowed.",'Battery Optimization: Set Battery to "Unrestricted" so Android Doze or iOS sleep doesn\'t delay alarms or push notifications.',"Why can't I see old messages? Because OurNest uses zero-knowledge encryption, only devices present when a message was sent hold the decryption keys.","Can people outside my family message me? No. OurNest has no public directory, no stranger search, and no unsolicited messages.","Where do ads appear? Non-intrusive family sponsor cards appear exclusively on the Home screen between Family Chat and Direct Messages. Zero pop-ups or chat disruptions.","Attribution: Developed by ARKIS PTE LTD. All rights reserved."]),t.s)
B.amD=new A.hz("Troubleshooting","9. FAQ & Troubleshooting Guide",B.v5,B.U,"Answers to common questions and system permission guidelines.",B.a14,null,null)
B.Zs=A.a(s(['Look above the chat typing bar for the Audience toggle: "Everyone" | "Selected...".',"Everyone (Default): Sends the message to every approved member of the family.","Selected: Opens a member picker. Check the boxes for the members you wish to include (e.g. Mom & Dad only).","Guaranteed Cryptographic Isolation: Members who are not selected do not receive message keys. They cannot decrypt or see the message in their feed.","1-to-1 Private Direct Chats: Tap any family member from the Home screen to open a private 1-on-1 encrypted chat channel.",'Delete for Everyone: Long-press any sent message and tap "Delete for Everyone" to replace it with a tombstone.']),t.s)
B.amE=new A.hz("Chat & Privacy","4. Everyone vs. Selected (Audience Control)",B.v4,B.z,"Choose who receives each message: the entire family or specific members.",B.Zs,"Open Family Chat","/chat/family")
B.a1Y=A.a(s(["Tap any family member in the Family screen to open their Rich Personal Profile Sheet.","Includes Profile Photo, Display Name, Relation badge, Status Quote, Sex, Blood Group, Date of Birth, automatic Age, and Birthday Countdown.","Shows Mobile Phone Number, WhatsApp Number (with 1-tap Call & WhatsApp buttons), Living Place / City, Full Home / Residential Address (with 1-tap [\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Map Address] Google Maps navigation), Education, Occupation, Working Place, Working Details, and Bio.",'Open the "\ud83c\udf82 Birthdays" tab on the Family screen to see all upcoming family birthdays sorted by days remaining, with a 1-tap "Send Birthday Wish \ud83c\udf82" button.']),t.s)
B.amF=new A.hz("Setup & Family","10. Rich Personal Profiles & Birthday Reminders",B.i7,B.j,"Complete member cards with photo, DOB, age, mobile/WhatsApp numbers, home address, education, work details & automatic birthday alerts.",B.a1Y,"Edit My Personal Profile","/profile-setup?edit=true")
B.YU=A.a(s(["Floating Pill Input Bar: Expands smoothly from 1 to 5 lines with a built-in \ud83d\ude0a/\u2328\ufe0f Emoji & Quick Phrase toggle, \ud83d\udcce Family Action Hub button, and auto-hiding \ud83d\udcf7 quick camera.","Morphing Action Orb: Shows \ud83c\udf99\ufe0f (Hold to record encrypted voice note) when the box is empty, and smoothly morphs into \u27a4 (Send) the moment you type.","Docked 8-Tile Family Action Hub: Tap \ud83d\udcce to access Gallery, Camera, Wake Alarm, Family Event, Voice Note, Live Location, Family Ask, and Paste Link in one clean grid.",'\ud83d\udccd Live & Current GPS Location: Tap "Live Location" in the \ud83d\udcce Action Hub (or the GPS icon in the chat top bar) to share your exact satellite coordinates with a 1-tap [\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Open Live Location in Google Maps] button!','1-Tap Family Quick Phrases: Tap \ud83d\ude0a to send instant warm family chips like "Reached safely \u2764\ufe0f", "Had food? \ud83c\udf5b", "Call me when free \ud83d\udcde", or "Wake me up \u23f0".']),t.s)
B.amG=new A.hz("Chat & Privacy","13. Smart Family Composer & Action Hub",B.v_,B.bh,"Floating pill composer, 1-tap family quick phrases, emoji switcher, and 8-tile Family Action Hub.",B.YU,"Try Smart Composer","/chat/family")
B.a1j=A.a(s(['Daily Chat Stays Private: By default, all messages in your family chat stay strictly inside your nuclear family ("\ud83c\udfe0 My Family").','3-Ring Connection System: In "\ud83c\udf33 Family Tree", tap "Link Family / Friend / Temple / Church" to connect: (1) \ud83c\udf33 Relative Families, (2) \ud83e\udd1d Friend & Neighbour Families, or (3) \ud83d\uded5\u26ea Church Fellowship / Temple Seva / Volunteer Groups.','Single Member & Volunteer Support: Unmarried youth, solo seniors, church members, and temple volunteers can join any group directly using 1-tap role chips ("\ud83d\uded5 Temple Volunteer", "\u26ea Church Member", "\ud83d\udc51 Group Coordinator", "\ud83d\udc64 Single Member").','\ud83d\udce2 Multi-Group Broadcast & Custom Circles: Tap "\ud83d\udce2 Broadcast & Custom Groups" in the Family Tree to broadcast announcements to All Relatives, All Friends, All Church/Temple Volunteers, or Saved Custom Circles in 1 tap!','Send Family-to-Family Invitations: Tap "Send Invitation / Message" on any linked group to message their Entire Group, Admins/Coordinators Only, or an Individual Member.']),t.s)
B.amH=new A.hz("Family Tree & Peace","11. Connected Family Tree, Church/Temple Volunteers & Broadcasts",B.i5,B.z,"Link Relative Families, Friend Families, and Church/Temple Volunteer Groups (including single members) & send 1-tap multi-group broadcasts.",B.a1j,"Open Family Tree","/family")
B.a20=A.a(s(["Open OurNest and enter your email address for 100% free, dynamic verification.","Enter the 6-digit verification code or tap the instant confirmation link in your email. No passwords to remember or lose.","Set up your Rich Family Profile: upload your Photo, Display Name, Status Line, Sex, Blood Group, Date of Birth, Living Place, Education, Occupation, Working Place, Working Details, and Bio.","OurNest securely generates your unique cryptographic device keys inside your phone's hardware vault (Android KeyStore / iOS Keychain).","Your profile information is strictly private and only visible to approved members of your family circle."]),t.s)
B.amI=new A.hz("Setup & Family","1. Getting Started & Sign In",B.v9,B.j,"100% Free Dynamic Email OTP login and rich personal family profile setup.",B.a20,"Edit Profile in Settings","/profile-setup?edit=true")
B.ZE=A.a(s(["Voice Notes: Press and hold the Microphone icon in the chat bar to record. Features a live wave timer. Slide left to the Trash Can to cancel.","Audio Playback: Includes play/pause, duration display, and a seek scrubber.",'Encrypted Photos: Tap "+" and select "Take a Photo" or "Choose from Gallery". Photos are encrypted on-device with pinch-to-zoom fullscreen viewer.','One-Touch Social Sharing: While watching YouTube or reading an article in Chrome/Safari, tap your phone\'s system "Share" button and select "OurNest". The link or photo will open straight in your family chat ready to send!']),t.s)
B.amJ=new A.hz("Media & Share","7. Voice Notes, Photos & YouTube Sharing",B.nI,B.z,"Hold-to-record voice notes, encrypted photos, and one-touch social sharing.",B.ZE,null,null)
